{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NEH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"尼希米记","commonName":"尼希米记","title":"尼希米记","order":16,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"7292aecb7c64fadc60d6b6d776782e501cf8c3418c6400b41e7fa1323f4e4c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NEH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NEH/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":403},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["尼希米的祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是哈迦利亚的儿子尼希米的记述。 波斯王亚达薛西二十年基斯流月",{"noteId":0},"，我在书珊城里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我的一个兄弟哈拿尼和一些人从犹大来到这里，我问他们有关从流亡之地归回的犹太余民和耶路撒冷的情况。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们回答说：“那些从流亡之地归回犹大省的余民深陷苦难，饱受凌辱。耶路撒冷的城墙已经倒塌，城门也被烧毁。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我一听见这消息，就坐下痛哭，悲伤了好几天。我在天上的上帝面前禁食祷告，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“天上的上帝耶和华啊，你是伟大而可畏的上帝，你向爱你、守你诫命的人守约，施慈爱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["仆人在你面前昼夜为你的众仆人以色列民祈祷，求你睁眼察看，侧耳倾听。我承认以色列人向你所犯的罪，包括我和我的家族所犯的罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们用非常败坏的行为得罪你，没有遵守你赐给你仆人摩西的诫命、律例和典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["求你顾念你对你仆人摩西所说的话，‘如果你们不忠，我必把你们驱散到列邦中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但如果你们转向我，谨遵我的诫命，即使你们流落天涯，我也必从那里把你们召集到我选为我名所在之地。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们是你的仆人、你的子民，是你用大能大力救赎的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["主啊，求你侧耳听你仆人的祷告，垂听那些喜爱敬畏你名的众仆人的祈求，使你仆人今天亨通，在王面前蒙恩。” 我是王的酒侍。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“基斯流月”即希伯来历的九月，阳历是十一月中旬到十二月中旬。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NEH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NEH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZR/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}